{"availability":"available","full":"a27497/samescale","name":"samescale","description":"AI Coding Agent 评测与验收平台：评测框架、Docker 隔离执行、独立结果校验、证据追溯与离线回放。真实 Codex 执行默认关闭，验收需操作员单独授权；不支持 Cursor/DeepSeek 原生记录。","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-22T12:23:06Z","updated":"2026-10-19T07:44:00Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://getsamescale.com","topics":["acceptance-testing","agent-evaluation","ai-agents","ai-coding","coding-agents","developer-tools","docker","evaluation-framework","evidence","fastapi","offline-replay","postgresql","python","typescript","vue"],"demo":"https://getsamescale.com/demo/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T04:01:50.661Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T04:01:50.661Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T04:01:50.661Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:11:47.035Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:31:51.325Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T07:03:06.953Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:46:17.365Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-20T04:01:50.661Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AI Coding Agent Evaluation & Diagnosis Workbench","把 Coding Agent 的一次运行，转化为可检查、可诊断、可复核的工程证据。 SameScale 关联 Trace、Episode、workspace changes 和独立验收，帮助回答：实际发生了什么、哪些结果已验证、失败停在哪一层，以及保存的证据能否离线复核。它不把局部运行结果写成模型排行榜。","Agent 说“done”只是一次输出，不等于任务契约通过。工程复盘还需要检查最终 workspace、工具轨迹和独立 verifier，区分任务失败、环境中断与尚未证实的模型或运行时原因。保留原始状态与未知项，才能在不再次调用模型的情况下复核结论。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/a27497/samescale/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c01d0f6ceb710f53b324434f6e11e4c6d159f0694e2bccbd73fc85693e9d93e9","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:03:07.048Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:03:07.048Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AI Coding Agent Evaluation & Diagnosis Workbench","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/a27497/samescale/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c01d0f6